counterfactuals.output:
A system comprising:

a web page configured to request advertising code from an application programming interface (API);

a server communicatively coupled to the API, the server including one or more processors and a memory storing a plurality of versions of the advertising code;

a code management module configured to identify, from the plurality of stored versions, a latest stored version of the advertising code; and

a delivery module configured, responsive to the request received from the web page via the API, to automatically provide the latest stored version of the advertising code to the web page without requiring the web page to specify the latest stored version,

wherein the web page is configured to execute or embed the received advertising code to present advertising content.
